{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3953340/extras/1708dd1b7f93cdef288fe63258e2b20f.poster.avif?t=1763113767\" width=1170 height=316 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3953340/extras/1708dd1b7f93cdef288fe63258e2b20f.webm?t=1763113767\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3953340/extras/1708dd1b7f93cdef288fe63258e2b20f.mp4?t=1763113767\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3953340/extras/30897ef604e10c54afc7d75fc594aaec.webp?t=1763113767\" width=600 height=52 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">\ud83d\udc96<strong> Play with your cat\u00a0</strong>\ud83d\udc96</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">\ud83e\udee7The cat generates gold every 30 seconds. Pet it or feed it to earn extra gold.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">\u00a0\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3953340/extras/d35d2b8386ee683fa33451dc6786f7e1.poster.avif?t=1763113767\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3953340/extras/d35d2b8386ee683fa33451dc6786f7e1.webm?t=1763113767\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3953340/extras/d35d2b8386ee683fa33451dc6786f7e1.mp4?t=1763113767\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"> <strong> \ud83e\udee7</strong>Drag and drop files or documents to the cat, and it will shred them and throw them into the trash.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">\u00a0\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3953340/extras/c07d19c4c809ec35c6ce0ecd6a377c9c.poster.avif?t=1763113767\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3953340/extras/c07d19c4c809ec35c6ce0ecd6a377c9c.webm?t=1763113767\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3953340/extras/c07d19c4c809ec35c6ce0ecd6a377c9c.mp4?t=1763113767\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong> \ud83e\udee7</strong>Right-click the cat to open various Windows tools and quickly access your desired folders.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3953340/extras/85020b595d9c6f80126b5040d81352b7.poster.avif?t=1763113767\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3953340/extras/85020b595d9c6f80126b5040d81352b7.webm?t=1763113767\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3953340/extras/85020b595d9c6f80126b5040d81352b7.mp4?t=1763113767\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"> <strong> \ud83e\udee7</strong>Do you have something to do? Write it in your To-Do List and set an alarm your cat will ring it for you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">\u00a0\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3953340/extras/c97d544871eab1e47074d2fa1ef86925.poster.avif?t=1763113767\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3953340/extras/c97d544871eab1e47074d2fa1ef86925.webm?t=1763113767\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3953340/extras/c97d544871eab1e47074d2fa1ef86925.mp4?t=1763113767\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>\ud83e\udee7</strong>Don\u2019t forget to buy a sofa! The cat will sit and enjoy music, movies, and more with you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">\u00a0\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3953340/extras/d6cf530b1619227885f8bc75c705dee6.poster.avif?t=1763113767\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3953340/extras/d6cf530b1619227885f8bc75c705dee6.webm?t=1763113767\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3953340/extras/d6cf530b1619227885f8bc75c705dee6.mp4?t=1763113767\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>\ud83e\udee7</strong>Use various accessories to dress up your chubby kitty\u2014make them even cuter!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3953340/extras/4bb494e67ee7c9d9f13c6b29c589e52a.poster.avif?t=1763113767\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3953340/extras/4bb494e67ee7c9d9f13c6b29c589e52a.webm?t=1763113767\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3953340/extras/4bb494e67ee7c9d9f13c6b29c589e52a.mp4?t=1763113767\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>\ud83e\udee7</strong>Write down anything you want to remember and organize it just like files.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>\ud83e\udee7</strong>You can track how long you've used each program.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">\ud83d\udc96\u00a0<strong>Adopt a cat and make it happy\u00a0</strong>\ud83d\udc96</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">\ud83e\udee7Spend time together, collect coins, adopt new furry friends, and buy items that make them happy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3953340/extras/cfbf5317fa6e27d57492dd4239f56fc2.webp?t=1763113767\" width=600 height=52 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong> \ud83e\udee7</strong>Decorate your desktop to your taste. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Adjust the cat\u2019s size and choose its personality to create your perfect companion.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">\u00a0\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3953340/extras/601963cbc981f051a002599540801f80.poster.avif?t=1763113767\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3953340/extras/601963cbc981f051a002599540801f80.webm?t=1763113767\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3953340/extras/601963cbc981f051a002599540801f80.mp4?t=1763113767\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3953340/extras/548c0877f410528c59c00097c4fff861.webp?t=1763113767\" width=600 height=52 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">\ud83e\udee7here\u2019s nothing complicated. Feed your cat, give them gentle pets, and collect gold to buy cute items and stylish furniture that make them happy!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Their adorable chubby-cat antics will brighten every moment you spend on your PC.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">\u2764\ufe0fEnjoy a sweet and special daily life with your very own desktop cat!\u2764\ufe0f</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">\u00a0\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3953340/extras/fc6cbf452aea235d19eae0e7e833ded4.poster.avif?t=1763113767\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3953340/extras/fc6cbf452aea235d19eae0e7e833ded4.webm?t=1763113767\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3953340/extras/fc6cbf452aea235d19eae0e7e833ded4.mp4?t=1763113767\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":" The first one","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3953340/f05449da00ab2b7f55e9a7d63b0c91c55101dfd6.jpg"},{"name":"Meow","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3953340/da96c2db439b31596990dd0e0b9b3fcfee6500e3.jpg"},{"name":"Being useful","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3953340/d67843269aa524f0367608036bdc710f18d3129d.jpg"},{"name":"Gotta do it","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3953340/e2bb4bf905dbe1cb8d5efc37d53b35b76033b32a.jpg"},{"name":"Time is gold","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3953340/d1bf91ee31cdba462b1c433791f45242abe586af.jpg"},{"name":"Even this?","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3953340/5702b5404bad65d1cfaff6bf74d7f1cca042b6a5.jpg"},{"name":"View point","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3953340/449eaded6ae53842334dea14537b0f00e106e14f.jpg"},{"name":"Something else will feed you","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3953340/aaf9b452859167071c28d0c26f75dc858fbd0314.jpg"},{"name":"Welcome!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3953340/e2f70d3da2c20733f47ac5c0ae6d283727bdb0c7.jpg"},{"name":"Meowrangers","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3953340/c3bb0c958dba776d83efdd1ebe789648bf661c91.jpg"}],"total":14},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3953340?t=1763113767","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3953340?t=1763113767","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3953340/dc4c9b8b20c8